{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 578,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a2e6d850412e4b9abab8893",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "成果当然是100分。\\n会让大家看到无可挑剔的竞赛表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78a08067cdaa1b087548a6c90dc0fcd651637664548005a1904a352c63b442d1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "25"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c73175884a2c61c4210d8f80",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不光是眼镜，我身上的所有东西都属于\\n胜利方程式的一环。颜色……则是个人喜好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef08f3973af432628a3041489afd3e7c807f25c94152a388cc360fbaca578532",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "250"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcd8a95a880a277c944016f6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "既是挚友也是劲敌……光这样形容还不够。\\n是难以解释的，超越「理论」的存在。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b379d800af018c0ab78b0b73d444aafb26d1af8c5ccf6bb4e43a5d97bcbc746a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "251"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb99729167ec0740921dfa17",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有在研究如何减少空气阻力……\\n你在看哪里？跟我的头无关喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a87a58300b09339e09d419d2f157a82eee0c71def6bea5b7abd1b03501c2d42c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "252"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6712d222922d70d47dbd1ba3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "人家会赢喔！然后呢～～会把你的视线\\n给抢过来♪做好觉悟吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c2400b01f62d541e960ad116b9ab24c052995c3e5fd0fefa9aa1dc52f65852e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "253"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c0a093417b0d38ed147c76d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "非常棒喔！我会咻咻咻咻地\\n把乌云和对手都吹飞☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac76554295f0069493be2dc5e1f54eda9dbeda36e99a804606e0d465551c242e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "254"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cdabeaca761055e2568a878",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯～人家才该被特别留意吧♪\\n如何……？刚才那样回答很成熟吧──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e9c0963fc31fafdf09fdbee0f23434c58e4bc3c8a97e232a68dfa12f0818aca",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "255"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0ac1bb108bc327736596cf5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "…………\\n我想追上……她的背影。",
      "source_fingerprint": "100baae54f3cc0e7a588db85a87c6a366ee7bbc3bb5a2dc27cc3d5a222e44e02",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "256"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dbb7dfb3a2851d6bee40cde",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……深焙的危地马拉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae97678893c38fa61993bd959e4b5b39a42f568be2c016e50b0f5ec7eaa58866",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "257"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e489e43599822721e0edeac3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……在黑暗的房间里…………一直待着……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b00c181a7ffa3042d862d9289ae6b4b1966200a9909684b8d5f248012d7eac3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "258"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c18ba88f686357d6c19aa69c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "电池已经充电完毕。\\n……我开玩笑的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55a0e9493a9a7cc3e86bc2bea9c34361289e15dbd89812ae704d0d6ac695cf45",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "259"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8597c6dacc7085844bb2c7d1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为朝第1迈进的我非常有自我风格，\\n我也最喜欢这样的自己♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "906cf1281c65f3ba4cd19276ae903779642d9b21a9af3306d0d91433aa54e117",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "26"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0354094ea25de908ac7f3961",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有时候会和朋友一起\\n「朝咖啡厅爆进──！」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cf47530fd79c632e99e495d6f56392905a80e8f0a99fc3947607df4d86b151a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "260"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33cf7346a36329615e56732d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "内存内是这么纪录着的，\\n「每一场都是蕴含庞大热能的激战」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a6f684bb2306b3a7d57ae93e3bef49a642fccd3b2e5b26c230a160331e07e92",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "261"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7863c7299edd94c4312d8298",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这个问题很难回答。腰大肌、内收肌群\\n和臀部肌群都很重要喔！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2263b2a7dc816d3eac9aeb8daa50ee27878b1a187eb035b0358c8ccd29b5243",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "262"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca2e131944b29da9f2f441d9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会看漫画。虽然是在休息，\\n但会看到心跳加速、身体发热……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b592d14668f2cc2e4c4796ce6027e710c3610e12e4b857142c2e964108a21f7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "263"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d62459d4338136b53b94b4b3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真要说的话虽然是会觉得沉重……\\n但我也只能尽自己所能！",
      "source_fingerprint": "35c5cc3cf7a746d4e2087acb05bd4305aaa2493b777872f05b84c6f22264860f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "264"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd78717c9a82f4e7577bc0b3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是100％喔～！就跟做给\\n小光的胡萝卜超人果汁一样♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "adbd7795ba05b71a6a738f7531526865cc63f5bbe98d4fb22e32e4dedfd0837e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "265"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13c79a99a4031dea226649f4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "相扑火锅！因为不管什么食材都适合煮，\\n然后会变得更好吃喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "04377ec8e48c569295576b5252894273204817044ed4f1a25aaf164eccc30d24",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "266"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b88d0a3d879b78363a834877",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最喜欢将对手丢出场外的招式……\\n啊，放心～我不会在竞赛中用的啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ff2701e7b537b510f714c47cc84d3b06f19921729f2a9c221b6492cf5893d07",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "267"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10ee76ec5300c0b038147187",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我和训练员一起努力到现在！\\n会让大家看到雪国的意志力的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3508c7cd88d8dac89ad8210be5e30dc740ae8c95bac7c2cf0f1a5d10b6d4fe9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "268"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4385d0789e7b2bbd0854486a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊，是故乡的记者吶！我很好喔！\\n一定要好好看看我的进步馁～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b131ba56559d3f286039e25a67f93226699f67ab7cd2a18857d56de35dd69f9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "269"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b6a64e8f096996720fb56c9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不，没有特别锁定谁喔？就算有人耍帅\\n或是大声喊叫，我也不会在意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae7e9ea2c09f36100357f28863f7eea7f80e65100375fdf918739c08fff485c7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "27"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7df09d7be63cd583e581012a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大家愿意来帮我加油真是太好了。\\n希望能带给大家一场满意的比赛～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1daf3993a1722e67d5c0c415302477743177cc9c2d2da9a8f331236b8c2bdc0a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "270"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e8d473d265504e58b9d9a0f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是、是、是的……那个……\\n我、我会虾油！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a68e524f370f4871719f801ba726952ac230ea9e89a066174443d9a06785be2f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "271"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1e8e89e0b1d3b456d736231",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为训练员非常努力协助，\\n所以……是100分！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f4c3ac327f2aea5e23c06574163701c3cd32c26e759f8070b9b883ff1d9bc43",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "272"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0aebd0b02bc93ba301606472",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有！之前有跟大……跟训练员一起外出。\\n……嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c181e432fe040bf8e4e70245703d8a3c3248e2358744d7759cbb0a89426bd04f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "273"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a06cb6bed4084c8d1fb3806",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哈啰哈啰──！我的家人们有在看吗──？",
      "source_fingerprint": "508ef238b6fe96e7ed7062115adeaa35aaa4268ef32fa539389025308b135c3b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "274"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdefb8cf6902bce8b2c53a71",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为我有在打工，\\n帮很多不同的餐厅外送料理！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba6ed9b5b335f06c342c98f30a7e8ce3bc4e3febb984db8156e7e7bfe63455b1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "275"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51a19a79bc3185bf33844c0d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯──跟小朋友相处？应该吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "86cb879294b0209a5e82aca6a764f239ed0d7be94dd645a4e97c56d53eb7c6f3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "276"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70aeef201f85d841099d375c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "早晨会喝红茶提振精神喔。热水与砂糖的\\n比例为1:1的特调红茶！",
      "source_fingerprint": "56ce64e7b9821c518a7c412d2d05cdf5a1cdbb045b093525b5246f9c8930edc1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "277"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad298feee931a9948700b648",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "绝对不能遗漏对跑者的观察。从动作和\\n表情能获取的信息可是很庞大的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a45db63515315a8f45c55b02058abd60ee7400641ff9b13141f0effcb73bd81",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "278"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca135bb8372bf0a1b2ed7697",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "应该是体验音速装置的运转测试吧。在拟真的\\nG力负荷面前，连我的三半规管也不行了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "767827587c89cdcb83243d9bb2d5d7c93de82ad0aafb1e9e94bc7bff9133433a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "279"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aabd3e3a0fa32b21c0a55da0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就是不要忘记吃早餐！\\n我今天早上也吃了1磅的牛排！",
      "source_fingerprint": "506e2a664f65dbac26a0e0c2f27651729e438c45e6d21b97e51ebce827d978da",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "28"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81c32f3935b2116a474c93f5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你高兴就好……不管是否受人期待，\\n我的跑法都不会变就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c51b5babc265a6ebf4c68019cb90d2d785bb5c7146387306a9ce7558afa3e25",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "280"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:039d3d21aab1ff3e2a75b97f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……是的。而且还是在刚起床的时候。\\n我当时真的不知道该做出什么反应。",
      "source_fingerprint": "713f8f9bbec3fe2b05f9d230aa48e8c4b6d8daa66f60d569e54841c10de17f55",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "281"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eec33cb7456745c8916bac40",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "…………运气。\\n我现在之所以还在跑也全是因为如此。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dc8d9dbed6953ec2003475d95188628081f2288115ec1364bcb60e3e93e9107",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "282"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3c83c055629e25bbe7af25d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会跑出令大家着迷的竞赛。\\n拜托大家给我连太阳公公都听得见的声援啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5855b820e9bf42bea01685ad5725b91f60b881579e7d040099c3b948f5ef857",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "283"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3cc0cc96d7056a8116cc205",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "去澡堂泡热水澡！然后回去时穿着木屐，\\n「咖答咖答」地走去神社祈祷胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "943e0e3a4a375f498c007302e09666df18b3b18d291db546eb2ba118708e62c0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "284"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b9eeb25981fe9a4fc843e10",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一边躺在榻榻米上一边喝浓～浓的茶！\\n这样最赞了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1c5b07b5eed19887a4c3cdaf83d8060cdc2f5771997ab08af628ab8ff88073a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "285"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d80309ada6640ece95853d8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "尽全力玩耍！像是打篮球、棒球、\\n玩鬼抓人，还有其他各种游戏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc5f34db12b27feca31a0c940a657d39a1fa57fd7740b327d47b3f3d885f4486",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "286"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fae7a9c67ea0a1b3565bcae2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "尽全力较劲！即使对手是朋友\\n也绝对不会放水喔！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a92a46772c21aa34e5623f3837ee6285563a769c09e0586766c08882b55e1ac4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "287"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c94b6821f304da499ebc911",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在桑拿比忍耐力！不过等我清醒时已经躺在\\n床上了呢。咦？那个算训练吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "483a3af372d226f8e4768a9d30bf1b9c8527107eef202a7f6a27a37fe319574b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "288"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b8011039f50036c37c757d1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啥？给我闭上嘴看着吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f03b300faef7775b77f8a86e18f832b447c670ef8bed0e62b27391008892905",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "289"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1b7e354b22f75e188b20c62",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会静坐让mind平静！\\nBeauty中不足的是会想睡觉呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b0c525859eae9db6cf39a369e2f9cfd2de68ec82c4bdcf0a7284dcd364b0ca4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "29"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5acfa01a8953a5fbb66b486c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊……忘记那是什么营养补充品了，\\n啥？营养补充品不算餐点？少啰嗦啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8454cc01f074d9d7e32ca2184e2da95162e72d790490eb90dcaed34b8f4a2830",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "290"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6379cd0ae5e2b5cb51f9bf09",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵呵……想挑衅我？如果有的话，\\n大概是能否遇上有骨气的对手吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d880009e86ae70cd6f7616cf8ffc62774fc64bd0e2036a55c690108491dab6a4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "291"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83a78ad25afbb0f4895952c3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "制定缜密的计划，\\n并且照预定计划去完成。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ffca90716b41f57fe48ffec579691940a1f1345658d1bc6eafe17d84ad06063",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "292"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7498771a373819a0498f715",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会毫无误差地\\n在目标时间内抵达终点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70b74f0dcdad850bc338efc69b5d7509582c5f39c265b38b7f5bde043c991e9e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "293"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f66e7ea1eda2cb4ad8afccf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这个嘛，黑森林蛋糕之类的吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "af4557662d2e56a5de2a233acaed0104335f5b0d5997e21a9de31ecc864e0b86",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "294"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9038494ed6044a5b92db34d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一早从伸展运动开始♪其他的例行公事\\n也全部都会分享到UG☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "c124a4fc4b329552f65df883284af5404706d1d7856a572b3ef14a04b056d7d6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "295"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5b8f71b7a61997484662a0e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会注意别吃太多！虽然这么说，但唯独遇到\\n可爱甜点时，就会忍不住……嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "77a72cb962a24c1296465966ebaa562112504e910e5ff09cce889224f2db9094",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "296"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:440ffda95061774ca99537c9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真机伶自己比较想被关注呢！\\n会展现出和平常不同的模样喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dc32ff0f0f0740e3105eefc8c7f918b53d6c642b3e31fb6e17c5062e0a77547",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "297"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a16f345e6dd5dde6f9caad9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "身为公主会以高雅的品格、优雅的姿态——\\n远远超越其他对手！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0383a801661b50dd0e57460bdca4f8549d44060f957d05779c57bba3a04c1a34",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "298"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:659edd030d1405a2f5a2bc7f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "平日就要将美丽的举止铭记于心……\\n哎呀，有只小虫在飞呢。看我的喝啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4acf9d0704cf777de1d98b0333220427dc395261ab84a659fe5af388333d4516",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "299"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e6ed9068e8577c760af024f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那个～内侧赛道……呃！\\n这个不能说出来～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "090559ceadb406f351e97461ba923bdcfc3c64990daad0c3ea8909dafb39712f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afc56e2ad0f76d7b1577fe5f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "与并跑练习的伙伴一起开派对后，\\n隔天想早起会very hard！",
      "source_fingerprint": "717640bb6454cf09cc151902ef8a66175e7cc6dc88205067a1c65e7f12fe0fda",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "30"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30dad04ab07246019c505b23",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "应该是用如公主般惹人怜爱的模样紧咬对手，\\n再用如小猫黏人般的执着穷追不舍吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c24665f4ceee93b2de8a471bf87b16eae6ea0e0e55f03d9e3ad32f287c4fbfdf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "300"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f70ee0902d0e4d1a9850bc7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那是两回事。\\n我今天要专注在竞赛上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "28322f524271850f05c414e4ff41f7727e1a8714c63aa1b4d05de3aade12d40e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "301"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:177df14e665b7853d479d554",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有许多比我还厉害的家伙。\\n──但我要做的事只有不畏惧地去挑战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c943bbf9e3cd77ef9632f033f122be4d573ee51fe973a3cb876e82723fddbf0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "302"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2d22d434e243b6a4b3b567a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我先说这发色是天生的。不仅显眼还容易\\n在竞赛中被盯上，相当麻烦呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "285fdfaf59e126947ec86ec4f49c3ad89bde2ded360b1f46d03543d14ad2eb44",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "303"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6841c54b50f86b571b5ec2a6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哼哼！既然你都这样拜托了，我就说吧。\\n简单来说……就是爆进！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3a08d01360e1bd8376813d62b4eca946d21a04071566a9ed34c484892638967",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "304"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc6fc608446c6e476d4e54d6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "起立！敬礼！我身为你们的班长，\\n会勇敢地跑下去！坐下──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "633d812f5d0bcfffc800010101b82af42e6b018f4fa2f58f4818177ddbbdf5cf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "305"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8d5c27e488a78a8ecd19abb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然是爆进！这样……好像是两个字？\\n不！要四个字就是爆进爆进！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2903c10191502bdeeea9489cd24aba9ec04f840da1a7bbf1cfa3f376560ee393",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "306"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c434c9c0ab0af8172bf74164",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你们一定要相信\\n我是比谁都更strong的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0c14db036d4e45e99d5d1dbb8445605b4215bd7dc1ccad88453a130cd497966",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "307"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66a1bb3381ac9935dd7926ec",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不只是打工而已喔。我做的每件事情\\n都是又hot又cool的喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "336ad9a2f746e2bc5d4d0d2ab70b1a6a6b4d4e5717d426eb8f3275b730c49cb0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "308"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a62fa73f11a214d3c2ffa75",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Look・at・me!\\n──这就是答案啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b33a88f2805204b237dbe87c8caf1c1a2d63ebc47c1322333072855eb67ac73",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "309"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d46f4d8f98344949f8975ab9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "过于紧绷反而容易受伤。\\n顺应情势，等待时机吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "e495304fd6393372246bc743555f6fc14d9f30b7e059cf66e303de25a1f51ca9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "31"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd22300319c89c60dde3b432",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "要用力咬紧对手！\\n……风风可不是开玩笑的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19bdfa6e1147b63b0fa605c1333846e8af14559acc3f8ca5fe6c2f5200e140e0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "310"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:812cec5e81658b50c18b4091",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "吼唔──！\\n风风要把所有人都打得落花流水──",
      "source_fingerprint": "e02317bb60aec0c1fedbf9c94684aa0df3247ec5d550a736e245a0b712f16afc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "311"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a8b67fa058378081a1156d3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是、是谁说的！唔唔唔……\\n风风绝对不要最后一名孤独过终点啦──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef2e3ca3ead5012a40ca51c3617ea7212925ca3ba0b4184c507a9cc4a8ba5e2e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "312"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7c0a673f2c79a44b2daa07a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "ふふーん、魔法よ、ま・ほ・う！　今日の\\nレースだってマジカルにひとっ飛びよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "31b6b62b1a3cef91f2f35e09d4b06a4838868a07d7bf1af01604ddb91f9dbe33",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "313"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:482d45fb034f7c650f683a98",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "偉大なる魔女グランマよ。昔、魔法の箒のよ\\nうにレースを軽やかに駆け抜けたんだから！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa843ef17fc5c84d3125dbd5da2057a3f0663172948c19dc5209dcddaba5d124",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "314"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4b752c0c7f0184eb7210f22",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "ふん、使い魔に恥ずかしいところは\\n見せないわ。期待しておいて！",
      "source_fingerprint": "53a703293f4f128df7193049427b06dee5cb161abaa40b9d4decebc25c364542",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "315"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb60c532eeba4dc9dea5d300",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会宠爱大家♪帮忙打扫洗衣服或\\n任～何事情，然后……呵呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ddf67917e864124fcfd2acdb7886f49e0885ca5ea9067dba437f4e907d2a2e1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "316"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d23d941f1624850d455626b9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那个……我担心记者小姐眼睛下面的\\n黑眼圈。你要好好休息才行喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f73924aa673eec3b365095237df282f81396d35eeb266bb8fa88ea5503a93e07",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "317"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58ba298ab146d27e5d84e24d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我做了饭团和大家一起吃。希望大家的努力和\\n成果都能像饭团的米饭一样黏在一起～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbe3cd4e2f7dbd7ee85b268ddffd1c0f882b1e7c664833f71645937458c22fc5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "318"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b11974f80952cbf5e7c5bcce",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然，不论是舞蹈、歌唱还是粉丝互动都～\\n准备万全啰♪啊，你是问竞赛？",
      "source_fingerprint": "193c6e63672d3a00fef1f9453d75c267201d4a48b39755f1f890d4c647512be4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "319"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:355b81308ec5130faf2ad12e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "越是了解日本文化，就越能体会其\\n深奥之处，所以实在不敢自称精通……",
      "source_fingerprint": "579f47a9911c735e57f9b4d3828c7ce359c3d082119e765fde87b70a5de99662",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "32"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8269d22d758e7252ca2f3471",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "唱演唱会歌曲就自然而然能放松啰☆\\n大力推荐这么做喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f417c3812bd5dcacac5535bc0e3e7a18ea40c68b3cb90f545c84b7c7a1d12962",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "320"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
